shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"HH5HeqALwq3qPUtF9gMeTA","review_id":"8vLojADzWMRCePi-TbYEeA","date":"2018-01-09T20:38:17","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9360222220420837,"text_excerpt":"Excited to have Mr. Chill's in the neighborhood. Rounding out all the burger and vietnamese places, having a gourmet hot dog restaurant is a welcome addition. I enjoyed the Duck Dog with Blackberry sauce, bacon & mustard. The buns are similar to that of \"other\" gourmet hot dog spots, large, a little sweet and doughy. I'm not a big chili fan but their array of chili's makes me want to give it a try. Lots of dog variety as well as a burger poboy, gumbo, yakamein and homemade pound cakes for dessert. A unique and welcomed spot for quick lunches."},{"business_id":"HH5HeqALwq3qPUtF9gMeTA","review_id":"xQdJOhmWjsC4pnMLRIj3Mw","date":"2018-08-30T21:42:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.919018030166626,"text_excerpt":"I am definitely a sucker for a good weenie...no pun intended. So when this lil joint opened up i had to give them a try. Its pretty small inside so small groups work best. They offer a nice assortment of dogs and also serve beer....winning! I ordered the Mr Chills cheese dog...i was skeptical at first bc it comes with sooo much ish on it but it was really tasty. Fries were super crunchy n tasty as well. They would have gotten a 5 but our table was a bit dirty n we wiped it off ourselves but definitely a place worth a return trip. Owner was super friendly."},{"business_id":"HH5HeqALwq3qPUtF9gMeTA","review_id":"tkauvTFiJd6_b2tvbBDEsg","date":"2018-01-22T01:11:16","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9021303653717041,"text_excerpt":"Very nice hotdogs! Exceptional bread and super condiments you are to check this palace out! The duck dog with black berry jam is excellent"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
